    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Eberron Campaign, Can't Have Another Dragonmark Feat)</em></p><p>The Mark of Sentinel of House Deneith manifests on your skin. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Sentinel's Intuition.</strong> When you make a Wisdom (Insight or Perception) check, you can roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to the check.</p><p><strong>Guardian's Shield.</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShield0000]{Shield} is always prepared for you. You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain that use when you finish a Long Rest; you can also cast it with any spell slots you have. Your spellcasting ability for this spell is Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma (chosen when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Vigilant Guardian.</strong> When a creature you can see within 5 feet of you is hit by an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to trade places with it, and the attack hits you instead. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Spells of the Mark.</strong> If you have the Spellcasting or Pact Magic feature, the spells on the Mark of Sentinel Spells table are added to that feature's spell list.</p><h4>Mark of Sentinel Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.zrukPdN6EG4QBnaG]{Compelled Duel}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShieldofFa]{Shield of Faith}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWardingBon]{Warding Bond}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplZoneofTrut]{Zone of Truth}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCounterspe]{Counterspell}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbProtectionFro]{Protection from Energy}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDeathWard0]{Death Ward}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGuardianof]{Guardian of Faith}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBigbysHand]{Bigby's Hand}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-6kspeaXhRNO7OUva\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect <em>Sentinel's Intuition</em> adds the 1d4 to the Insight and Perception checks. The Spells of the Mark are not added to your class spell list automatically: prepare them from the compendium if your class can. <em>Vigilant Guardian</em> spends a use of the feat; swap the two tokens yourself.</p></section>",
